sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
The inherited header contains content that should not touch its edge.

```css
header {
  padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
}
```

**Line by line:** `header` selects the shared page header. The first padding value applies to top and bottom. The second applies to left and right. The content stays inside the same semantic header.

