sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
The existing navigation links need space between neighboring boxes.

```css
nav a {
  margin-right: 1rem;
}
```

**Line by line:** `nav a` reuses the relationship selector learned earlier. `margin-right` adds outside space after each link. No extra HTML wrappers are required.

