sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
The inherited profile image already works. CSS can frame it without replacing the asset.

```css
img {
  border: 4px solid #cbd5e1;
  padding: 0.25rem;
}
```

**Line by line:** `img` selects the existing image. The border draws the outer line. Padding creates a small gap between the image content and that border.

